---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {projects} from '../data/projects';
const email=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL||'hello@nrth.group',investors=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_INVESTORS_EMAIL||'investors@nrth.group',partnerships=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_PARTNERSHIPS_EMAIL||'partnerships@nrth.group';
---
<Layout title='Contact' description='Introduce a question, a project, a partnership or an investor perspective to NRTH. Prepare and review your message before sharing.'>
 <section class='contact-heading'><span class='section-label'>Connect with NRTH</span><h1>Make an<br/><em>introduction.</em></h1><p>Tell us what you see, what you are working on and where you think a conversation could lead.</p></section>
 <section class='contact-layout'><div class='contact-side'><p>A short introduction is enough to begin. Choose the relevant venture or the type of conversation, then add the context that matters.</p><div class='contact-addresses'><span>General & venture inquiries</span><a href={'mailto:'+email}>{email}</a><span>Partnerships</span><a href={'mailto:'+partnerships}>{partnerships}</a><span>Investors</span><a href={'mailto:'+investors}>{investors}</a></div></div>
 <form class='contact-form' hidden data-inquiry-form data-contact-email={email} data-partnerships-email={partnerships} data-investors-email={investors}>
  <div class='form-field'><label for='name'>Your name</label><input id='name' name='name' autocomplete='name' required maxlength='120' placeholder='How should we address you?'/></div>
  <div class='form-field'><label for='email'>Email address</label><input id='email' name='email' type='email' autocomplete='email' required maxlength='254' placeholder='you@company.com'/></div>
  <div class='form-field'><label for='organization'>Organization <span>Optional</span></label><input id='organization' name='organization' autocomplete='organization' maxlength='180' placeholder='Your company or team'/></div>
  <div class='form-field'><label for='project'>The conversation</label><select id='project' name='project'><option value='general'>A general introduction</option>{projects.map(project=><option value={project.slug}>{project.name}</option>)}<option value='partnership'>A partnership</option><option value='investor'>An investor conversation</option></select></div>
  <div class='form-field form-wide'><label for='message'>What do you have in mind?</label><textarea id='message' name='message' required minlength='10' maxlength='5000' placeholder='The question, the context and the possibility you see.'></textarea></div>
  <div class='inquiry-trap' aria-hidden='true'><label for='website'>Leave this empty</label><input id='website' name='website' tabindex='-1' autocomplete='off'/></div>
  <p class='form-note form-wide'>You will review this message before sharing it. Keep medical records, passwords and other sensitive information out of a general inquiry. <a href='/privacy'>Website privacy</a>.</p>
  <button class='form-submit form-wide' type='submit'>Review your introduction</button>
  <div class='inquiry-result' data-inquiry-result hidden tabindex='-1'><h3>Take a look before sharing.</h3><p data-inquiry-review-note>Check the details, then choose how you would like to share your introduction.</p><pre class='inquiry-preview' data-inquiry-preview></pre><div class='inquiry-actions'><button type='button' data-inquiry-send>Send inquiry</button><a data-inquiry-email hidden>Open email app</a><button type='button' data-inquiry-copy>Copy message</button><a data-inquiry-download download='nrth-introduction.txt'>Save a copy</a><button type='button' data-inquiry-edit>Keep editing</button></div><p class='inquiry-error' data-inquiry-error role='alert' hidden></p><p class='inquiry-status' data-inquiry-status role='status' aria-live='polite'></p></div>
 </form><noscript><p>Use the email addresses here to make an introduction. The on-page review tool requires JavaScript.</p></noscript></section>
</Layout>
